{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/8799c00a4512fc546ec87be87d2ab5cc.poster.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/8799c00a4512fc546ec87be87d2ab5cc.webm?t=1767033667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/8799c00a4512fc546ec87be87d2ab5cc.mp4?t=1767033667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You've been hired by the <i>slightly shady</i> Clookoo Transport company to travel the world cleaning up corruption that they <i>may have caused</i>. In return, you get your very own free* train station!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gelli Fields is a casual farming game that lets you enjoy addicting gameplay from roguelike and upgrade based games without the stress of time limits or losing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Train station is only free if you work an unpaid job for the rest of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/bf889e7bc215db267811f6c63f8c6cc0.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.poster.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.webm?t=1767033667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.mp4?t=1767033667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase seeds from the gift shop, plant them, and watch them grow!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your farming skills and get <strong>rare</strong> variant crops!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a fan of watching crops grow? Click near your crops to help them grow quicker!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all sorts of things to plant from ancient vegetables to golden fruit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/acbd7658553ffc3ca60415c58fa84bd0.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.poster.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.webm?t=1767033667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.mp4?t=1767033667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed gellis for different effects depending on the biome like creating spells and even giving you money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch them interact with their environment and each other. Each gelli has its own personality!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read about each gelli in their biomes <i>gelli book</i>! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give a gelli its favorite food and you might get a gift!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/cc971d5c46067bc25140e3cd53992082.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.poster.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.webm?t=1767033667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.mp4?t=1767033667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 40 &quot;critter&quot; items like fish and bugs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with birds before they fly away to collect their feathers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read about collected critters and get rewards from biome books!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fun minigames like juggling wooden logs, mining through a mountain, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/54e7173b350cede2dc41bfa7f7afddac.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.poster.avif?t=1767033667\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.webm?t=1767033667